# Real MaxMind/DBIP databases for the wintcp/tests fixtures. Never commit a
# .mmdb: these files are licensed and redistributing them is forbidden, which is
# the whole reason WinTCP ships none. They are LOCAL test fixtures only - the
# tests use them when present and skip cleanly when not, so a fresh clone still
# gates green. See docs/development.md.
*.mmdb
.kilo
